{"id": "t143-004", "text": "Kevin and Ellie picked up their new puppy, a cockapoo called Waffle. The kids are obsessed apparently", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kevin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new puppy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cockapoo called Waffle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "obsessed", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t143-006", "text": "Milan's grandad passed away on Sunday. Funeral is the 28th at St Mary's, wake at the Red Lion afterwards. He was really close to him, lived with him for two years at uni. Milan's doing the eulogy and he's terrified of standing up in front of everyone. Send a card to his mum, and check in with Milan the day after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 28th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wake at the Red Lion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "close to him", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "eulogy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified of standing up in front of everyone", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send a card to his mum", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with Milan", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t143-009", "text": "Demi and Jack have split up. Demi's staying at her sister Ruby's for now. Jack moved out the day after they told everyone.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Demi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Demi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ruby", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after they told everyone", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t143-015", "text": "Dalia's wedding is off. She found out about him and the ex. She's moving back in with her parents in Bristol next month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Bristol", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t143-016", "text": "Anya's sitting her bar exams in February 2027 and she's barely sleeping. Her boyfriend Tunde is doing all the cooking so she can revise. Remind me to send her a care package the week before, and maybe ask Tunde what she actually needs. She mentioned she's living on those protein bars and black coffee and her cat Olive keeps sitting on her notes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bar exams", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a care package", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Tunde what she actually needs", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Olive", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t143-017", "text": "marisol - new kitten Mochi, tabby, 10wks. turns out she's allergic?? sneezing nonstop lol", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "marisol", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new kitten Mochi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}]}
{"id": "t143-019", "text": "Gintaras lost his job at the warehouse last Friday, the whole night shift got let go. He's applying for forklift jobs and has an interview on the 4th. Seems pretty flat about it all. His wife Dalia's picked up extra shifts at the care home to cover the mortgage. He doesn't want people making a fuss but I should ask how the interview went the day after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost his job at the warehouse", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty flat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "picked up extra shifts at the care home", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how the interview went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t143-020", "text": "Camila's sister Nia had her baby! A girl, Rosa, 7lb 2. Camila flies out to Lisbon on Tuesday to meet her and comes back the Sunday after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies out to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sunday after", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t143-027", "text": "Coffee with Giulia and Farid, they've moved in together finally. Giulia's been signed off with stress since the restructure at her work, the redundancy consultation finishes on 30 November 2026 and she won't know until then if her role survives. Farid's doing better, passed his theory last week and has the practical booked for January 2027. Their dog Luna had six puppies and they're keeping one. If I want one they'll be ready the week before Christmas. Remind me to ask Giulia how the consultation went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved in together", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "signed off with stress", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy consultation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "30 November 2026", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until then"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing better", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "theory", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "practical", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "January 2027", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Luna", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "EVENT", "text": "six puppies", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before Christmas"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Giulia how the consultation went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t143-035", "text": "Aleksander, Aleks to everyone at work, said it's a year since his dad died on 5 December. He's dreading it. Send him the name of that grief counsellor I saw.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aleksander", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aleks", "same_as": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send him the name of that grief counsellor I saw", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grief counsellor"}]}
{"id": "t143-038", "text": "Hamza Haddad from five a side mentioned his mum passed in the summer. Had no idea. He's going back to Amman for the memorial on 15 November 2026.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza Haddad", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from five a side", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to Amman", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "memorial", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 November 2026", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t143-040", "text": "Dalia's results day is the 20th. If she gets the grades she's off to Glasgow for vet med, if not she's doing a gap year at the animal sanctuary.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 20th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "off to Glasgow for vet med", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gap year at the animal sanctuary", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t143-043", "text": "Tunde failed his driving test again, 4th time, three serious faults on the big roundabout. Booked another for March 2027. Don't make a big deal of it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "another", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2027", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t143-044", "text": "Marisol's partner Ricardo was let go from the bank. She says he's sleeping all day. Their anniversary is next week but they've cancelled the Porto trip. Check in with Marisol. She's also worried about their dog Benny, who's got arthritis and is costing a fortune in tablets, and her own probation review at work is on 2 December 2026. Lot going on for her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ricardo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "let go from the bank", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with Marisol", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Benny", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "arthritis", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "probation review", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 December 2026", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t143-047", "text": "Mehmet Tanaka passed his viva with minor corrections!! Graduation is July 2027. Remind me to get him something nice for that.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet Tanaka", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viva", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Graduation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get him something nice for that", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t143-049", "text": "Funeral for Camila's uncle Arturo is Friday 6 November 2026 in Croydon. Service at 11, then the crematorium, then back to her aunt's house afterwards. She asked if I'd do a reading. Need to tell her yes by Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "uncle", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arturo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday 6 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "reading", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "tell her yes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t143-050", "text": "Abebe's mum lost her job at the council. He's helping out with rent. Twenty years she was there. She's applying for an admin role at the hospital, interview was supposed to be last week but they moved it to the 3rd. Ask Abebe if she's heard back, and whether she wants me to look over her CV.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost her job at the council", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "to the 3rd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Abebe if she's heard back, and whether she wants me to look over her CV", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t143-051", "text": "so Kevin rang, he's taking the dog to the vet Monday, um, Pickle's got this lump on his back leg and they'll do the biopsy that day and results like a week after. He's really worried because his last dog had cancer. Oh and Kiara's driving test got moved to the eighteenth of December twenty twenty six. Need to remember to ask how Pickle got on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kevin", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "vet", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "lump on his back leg", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "biopsy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that day", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "like a week after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "to the eighteenth of December twenty twenty six", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how Pickle got on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t143-052", "text": "archie & ellie's daughter has her ballet audition at the royal academy sat morning. they're driving down the night before. bring her a good luck card", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "archie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ellie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ballet audition at the royal academy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sat morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving down", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring her a good luck card", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t143-057", "text": "Anya has nursing finals the week of 10 May 2027. Placement's on the stroke ward and she loves it, wants to go into A&E afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursing finals", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week of 10 May 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on the stroke ward", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to go into A&E", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t143-059", "text": "Eva's mum Mrs Zhou has her citizenship ceremony next Thursday. Eva's organising lunch for the whole family afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Zhou", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "citizenship ceremony", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch for the whole family", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t143-060", "text": "Kiara called off her trip to see her dad, he's not well enough for visitors. Vet bills for the cat on top, she's skint. Maybe drop round with food on Saturday. She's also got her driving test on the 9th and hasn't had a lesson in a month, so she's thinking of moving it to January 2027. Ask her what she decided.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not well enough for visitors", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "skint", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round with food", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "to January 2027"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her what she decided", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "before"}]}
